_downloads":false,"has_wiki":false,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":true,"forks_count":18214,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":1927,"license":{"key":"apache-2.0","name":"Apache License 2.0","spdx_id":"Apache-2.0","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/apache-2.0","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTI="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":["airflow","apache","apache-airflow","automation","dag","data-engineering","data-integration","data-orchestrator","data-pipelines","data-science","elt","etl","machine-learning","mlops","orchestration","python","scheduler","workflow","workflow-engine","workflow-orchestration"],"visibility":"public","forks":18214,"open_issues":1927,"watchers":47308,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/pulls/75321","html_url":"https://github.com/apache/airflow/pull/75321","diff_url":"https://github.com/apache/airflow/pull/75321.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/apache/airflow/pull/75321.patch","merged_at":"2026-10-21T15:23:44Z"},"body":"Follow-up to #71654, which fixed this for Dag runs.\n\nA task instance that the executor reports as failed while it is still queued (worker or pod dying before the task starts) goes through `handle_failure`, which sets `end_date` and the state but never `start_date`. The nullable `start_date` lower bound treats a NULL `start_date` as \"not started yet, will start after the bound\", so these finished task instances kept showing up under any `start_date_gte` / `start_date_gt` filter on the task instance list endpoints. Restricting the NULL branch to `end_date IS NULL` keeps genuinely pending task instances matched and drops the finished ones.\n\nJobs use the same nullable filter but always get a `start_date` on creation, so they are not affected.\n\nrelated: #70627\n\n---\n\n##### Was generative AI tooling used to co-author this PR?\n\n- [X] Yes — Claude Code (Opus 5.5)\n\nGenerated-by: Claude Code (Opus 5.5) following [the guidelines](https://github.com/apache/airflow/blob/main/contributing-docs/05_pull_requests.rst#gen-ai-assisted-contributions)","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/75321/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/75321/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"}]]
